1. Heat the food in the microwave.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (heated food)
   )
   ```

2. Place the heated food on the desk in the living room.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (item_on food desk)
   )
   ```

3. Place the water bottle on the desk in the living room.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (item_on water_bottle desk)
   )
   ```

4. Store the eggs in the egg container in the kitchen.
   ```pddl
   (:goal
       (item_in eggs egg_container)
   )
   ```